A note on scope, since this repository indexes someone else's content:

This notice covers the source code in this repository only. The knowledge-base
articles HawkEye crawls, chunks, and retrieves are the property of SUNY New
Paltz, are not licensed here, and are not distributed with this repository --
`knowledge-base/` is gitignored, and the `Internal-Documentation` category is
access-gated and deliberately excluded from the automated refresh. Anyone running
this needs their own authorized access to that source material.
